                                                "sense_id": "4bde9e70-aa7f-3dfc-bd36-c7d8471108a9",
                                                "text": "Vanilla extract makes these cookies taste great, but the straight extract tastes bad because the alcohol hasn't evaporated yet."
                                            }
                                        ]
